Local changes: imports target the existing design system; PromptInput is a
text-only adaptation of the form and IME-safe textarea (Coach has no attachment
upload endpoint); motion respects reduced-motion preferences.

Tool, Plan and Confirmation adapted 2026-10-09 from the same source.
Tool accepts localized domain result headers and deliberately omits raw JSON
inputs/outputs. Plan reuses the existing workout calendar. Confirmation adapts
the presentation state only; all approvals still use the existing domain ledger.

Coach visual adaptation: disclosure headers are unframed inline rows with a
trailing chevron; result surfaces use the product's neutral background tokens,
not nested borders. Focus indicators and semantic chart strokes are retained.

Context composition adapted 2026-10-09 from the AI Elements Context reference.
It uses a touch/keyboard-accessible Popover, localized domain input-budget
estimates and no tokenlens cost estimate. Unavailable usage is not shown as zero.

Reasoning adapted 2026-10-09 from the official Reasoning registry component.
Only explicitly public, validated analysis summaries are displayed. Content is
escaped plain text; no code/diagram plugins or local invented timers. Manual
disclosure choices override automatic transitions and history starts collapsed.
